  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You draw the breath out of a creature.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or be <strong>Stunned</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, while the target is <strong>Stunned</strong>, it begins to suffocate. At the start of its turn, it must make another opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check, or fail to catch a breath. If it fails a number of times greater than 1 + its <strong>Body</strong>, it dies immediately as per the rules for <strong>Suffocation</strong>.</p><p>This spell only affects living, physical creatures that need to breathe.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.S8R6rdkwsaPuWdm6]{Steal Breath}</p>",
